    "description": "This is a standalone GUI application for pre and post processing of benthic video annotations with biigle. It has been developed as part of the FUTURE-OBS research project which aims to find innovative observation methods for coastal socio-ecosystem and is based on videos taken with the towed benthic sled Pagure. However it can be used and extended for other acquisition systems.",
